0..75 Comment "// Vectors: lists indexed by their length, a family whose constructors each"
76..147 Comment "// state the index their value stands at (Dybjer, _Inductive families_,"
148..222 Comment "// doi:10.1007/BF01211308). The kind `Nat -> Type` reads the length\'s type"
223..300 Comment "// before the universe; `VNil` stands at zero and `VCons` at the successor of"
301..376 Comment "// its tail\'s length, so a vector\'s type says how long it is. What a vector"
377..416 Comment "// refuses is in the pathological twin."
418..455 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
